# Declared views: selection, grouping, form and marks, as relations of a view entity.
The program "app" contains the process "server", the process "client" and the key-value store "Store".
The machine "server host" contains the process "server".
The process "server" runs on the machine "server host".
The thread "mqtt" fills the key-value store "Store".
The thread "clock" fills the key-value store "Store".
The thread "monitor" reads the key-value store "Store".
# selection by entity and by type; form and marks
The view "energy" shows the key-value store "Store".
The view "energy" shows every "thread".
The view "energy" has the form "matrix".
The view "energy" marks "gaps" and "states".
# grouping by a lexicon relation; without a form or marks sentence the defaults apply
The view "deployment" shows every "process" and "machine".
The view "deployment" groups by "runs on".
# errors: unknown type and relation, form and mark outside the vocabulary, negation, repeated form,
# view without a selection
The view "a" shows every "gizmo".
The view "b" groups by "flies over".
The view "c" has the form "circle".
The view "d" marks "colors".
The view "e" never shows every "thread".
The view "f" shows every "thread".
The view "f" has the form "list".
The view "f" has the form "matrix".
The view "g" has the form "list".
